window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Talented ballerina Cierra Gomez had high aspirations, but after a meeting with the mysterious Dr. Vlad Acula, her life takes an unexpected turn. She must decide between her human life and Vlad's unending love as she ventures further into his realm. Cierra navigates vampire politics, terrible secrets, and a developing war that threatens everything she holds dear. She is torn between her commitment and the attraction of immortality.</p> <p>However, love — especially vampire love - has a cost. Cierra must battle to save her new family and her unimagined future when she learns of her true ancestry and encounters hostile opponents. Can Cierra withstand the upcoming challenges and accept her fate beside the guy who has captured her heart and soul, knowing that her transformation into a vampire is imminent?</p> <p>Experience a story of forbidden love, loyalty, and the struggle between light and darkness in this gripping retelling of Dracula. The distinction between fate and desire has never been hazier for Cierra.</p>"; 
